        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n30 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the area must succeed at a DC 19 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (plus slowed 1 for as long as it's sickened on a critical failure)\n\nWhile within the aura, affected creatures take a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves against disease and to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune to all globsters' stenches for 1 minute."
            },
            "id": "6c27a729-fddc-4f32-a293-32c196c8c090",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:27.494111"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Nauseating Slap"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(poison)\n\nA living creature struck by a globster's tendril must attempt a DC 19 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature becomes sickened 1. If the creature is already sickened, the condition value increases by 1, to a maximum of sickened 4. Once a creature succeeds at its saving throw, it is temporarily immune for 24 hours."
            },
            "id": "7ca4d09b-5389-46b4-aa18-171948e037c2",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:27.494111"
